  "ORIX Clean does not check for updates on its own because it never connects to the network.": {
   "localizations": {
    "en": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "ORIX Clean does not check for updates on its own because it never connects to the network."
     }
    },
    "fr-CA": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "ORIX Clean ne recherche pas les mises à jour par lui-même, car il ne se connecte jamais au réseau."
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "ORIX Clean has no account, no network code, no analytics and no advertising. Scan results stay in memory; only volume samples, watched-folder sizes, cleanup logs and your saved actions are stored, in a local database.": {
   "localizations": {
    "en": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "ORIX Clean has no account, no network code, no analytics and no advertising. Scan results stay in memory; only volume samples, watched-folder sizes, cleanup logs and your saved actions are stored, in a local database."
     }
    },
    "fr-CA": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "ORIX Clean n’a ni compte, ni code réseau, ni télémétrie, ni publicité. Les résultats d’analyse restent en mémoire; seuls les échantillons de volumes, les tailles des dossiers surveillés, les journaux de nettoyage et vos actions enregistrées sont stockés, dans une base de données locale."
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "ORIX Clean shows its size, who signed it, and the files in your Library that carry its identifier. Your documents are never part of an uninstall.": {
   "localizations": {
    "en": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "ORIX Clean shows its size, who signed it, and the files in your Library that carry its identifier. Your documents are never part of an uninstall."
     }
    },
    "fr-CA": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "ORIX Clean indique sa taille, son signataire et les fichiers de votre Bibliothèque qui portent son identifiant. Vos documents ne font jamais partie d’une désinstallation."
     }
    }
   }
  },
