  "Recreatable data in documented locations. Apple system caches and caches that hold application state are never listed. Removing caches does not make a Mac faster; it returns space that applications may use again.": {
   "localizations": {
    "en": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Recreatable data in documented locations. Apple system caches and caches that hold application state are never listed. Removing caches does not make a Mac faster; it returns space that applications may use again."
     }
    },
    "fr-CA": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Données recréables dans des emplacements documentés. Les caches système d’Apple et les caches qui contiennent l’état d’une application ne sont jamais listés. Supprimer des caches ne rend pas un Mac plus rapide; cela rend de l’espace que les applications peuvent réutiliser."
     }
    }
   }
  },
